  "transcript": [
    {
      "start": 2.19,
      "end": 7.59,
      "text": "On 275 and 285, also in stereo on VHF, this is National Radio 1.",
      "source": "TV"
    },
    {
      "start": 8.69,
      "end": 23.39,
      "text": "There, this is TV on the radio here, Thomas the Vance, and welcome once again to The Friday Rock Show.",
      "source": "TV"
    },
    {
      "start": 24.61,
      "end": 32.61,
      "text": "Right, this Friday night we revisit Reading 1981 again to replay some of the music that shot out toward the heavens at the 21st Festival just a few weekends ago.",
      "source": "TV"
    },
    {
      "start": 49.93,
      "end": 55.93,
      "text": "Tonight you can hear Samson from London, Trust from France, and Steve Hackett, whom I think originated in Muswell Hill.",
      "source": "uncertain"
    },
    {
      "start": 55.93,
      "end": 59.75,
      "text": "No Friday night connection tonight, it's all concert music",
      "source": "uncertain"
    },
    {
      "start": 59.75,
      "end": 64.07,
      "text": "So you can settle back for the next two hours and feast your ears on some good sounds",
      "source": "TV"
    },
    {
      "start": 64.07,
      "end": 65.59,
      "text": "And we start with Samson",
      "source": "uncertain"
    },
    {
      "start": 65.59,
      "end": 72.79,
      "text": "Bruce Bruce on the vocals, Paul Samson on guitar and backing vocals",
      "source": "TV"
    },
    {
      "start": 72.79,
      "end": 1449.52,
      "text": "[Music]",
      "type": "music"
    },
    {
      "start": 1449.52,
      "end": 1451.84,
      "text": "Chris Elmer on the bass and Mel Gaynor on the drums",
      "source": "uncertain"
    },
    {
      "start": 1451.84,
      "end": 1453.28,
      "text": "The tracks you heard by Samson were",
      "source": "TV"
    },
    {
      "start": 1453.28,
      "end": 1456.48,
      "text": "Riding With The Angels, Earth Mother, Nice Girls, Vice Versa",
      "source": "TV"
    },
    {
      "start": 1456.48,
      "end": 1458.08,
      "text": "And Take It Like A Man",
      "source": "uncertain"
    },
    {
      "start": 1458.08,
      "end": 1459.82,
      "text": "It's 26 and a half minutes after 10",
      "source": "uncertain"
    },
    {
      "start": 1459.82,
      "end": 1462.24,
      "text": "And of course Bruce Bruce has now left that band",
      "source": "uncertain"
    },
    {
      "start": 1462.24,
      "end": 1464.32,
      "text": "And become the lead vocalist with Iron Maiden",
      "source": "uncertain"
    },
    {
      "start": 1464.32,
      "end": 1474.08,
      "text": "You're listening to the Friday Rock Show",
      "source": "TV"
    },
    {
      "start": 1474.08,
      "end": 1475.9,
      "text": "coverage of the Reading Festival for",
      "source": "uncertain"
    },
    {
      "start": 1475.9,
      "end": 1478.02,
      "text": "1981. And now we turn to the",
      "source": "uncertain"
    },
    {
      "start": 1478.02,
      "end": 1480.12,
      "text": "French band called Trust.",
      "source": "uncertain"
    },
    {
      "start": 1480.62,
      "end": 1486.02,
      "text": "A band from France by the name of Trust.",
      "source": "uncertain"
    },
    {
      "start": 3629.18,
      "end": 3630.7,
      "text": "Bernard Bonvoissant on vocals,",
      "source": "uncertain"
    },
    {
      "start": 3630.88,
      "end": 3633.08,
      "text": "Vivi Brusco on guitar. That's the bass guitar.",
      "source": "uncertain"
    },
    {
      "start": 3633.22,
      "end": 3634.86,
      "text": "Mathieu Chemlech on one of the",
      "source": "uncertain"
    },
    {
      "start": 3634.86,
      "end": 3637.04,
      "text": "lead guitars, Nono Cruyff on guitar",
      "source": "TV"
    },
    {
      "start": 3637.04,
      "end": 3638.76,
      "text": "and Nico McBrain on the drums.",
      "source": "uncertain"
    },
    {
      "start": 3638.94,
      "end": 3640.68,
      "text": "A heavy band. And when they left the stage,",
      "source": "uncertain"
    },
    {
      "start": 3641.1,
      "end": 3642.74,
      "text": "Bernard Bonvoissant was absolutely",
      "source": "uncertain"
    },
    {
      "start": 3642.74,
      "end": 3644.8,
      "text": "saturated in sweat. The numbers",
      "source": "uncertain"
    },
    {
      "start": 3644.8,
      "end": 3646.7,
      "text": "you heard by them were antisocial, Paris",
      "source": "uncertain"
    },
    {
      "start": 3646.7,
      "end": 3648.52,
      "text": "is still burning, pick me up, put me down.",
      "source": "uncertain"
    },
    {
      "start": 3648.52,
      "end": 3651.5,
      "text": "in the name of the race, Mindless and Death Instinct.",
      "source": "TV"
    },
    {
      "start": 3652.18,
      "end": 3655.18,
      "text": "Mrs. Redding.",
      "source": "TV"
    },
    {
      "start": 3923.21,
      "end": 3924.23,
      "text": "Fine, thank you, yes.",
      "source": "uncertain"
    },
    {
      "start": 3924.81,
      "end": 3929.84,
      "text": "This next one is a cross between Mantovani and Weather Report.",
      "source": "uncertain"
    },
    {
      "start": 3932.35,
      "end": 3932.79,
      "text": "A bit of a mixture.",
      "source": "uncertain"
    },
    {
      "start": 3934.14,
      "end": 3935.66,
      "text": "This one's from a special Mornings album.",
      "source": "uncertain"
    },
    {
      "start": 3939.88,
      "end": 3941.6,
      "text": "This is called Every Day.",
      "source": "uncertain"
    },
    {
      "start": 3942.16,
      "end": 3948.16,
      "text": "Now we're going to try something from an older album.",
      "source": "uncertain"
    },
    {
      "start": 4363.57,
      "end": 4365.01,
      "text": "This one's from Voyage of the Acolyte.",
      "source": "uncertain"
    },
    {
      "start": 4369.16,
      "end": 4372.02,
      "text": "It's called Ace of Wands.",
      "source": "uncertain"
    },
    {
      "start": 4372.02,
      "end": 4375.02,
      "text": "by myself and Nick",
      "source": "uncertain"
    },
    {
      "start": 4774.59,
      "end": 4776.71,
      "text": "Nick Magnus, the keyboard player up here",
      "source": "uncertain"
    },
    {
      "start": 4776.71,
      "end": 4780.12,
      "text": "and this one was written in",
      "source": "uncertain"
    },
    {
      "start": 4780.12,
      "end": 4781.82,
      "text": "sunny downtown",
      "source": "uncertain"
    },
    {
      "start": 4781.82,
      "end": 4783.2,
      "text": "Dulles Hill",
      "source": "uncertain"
    },
    {
      "start": 4783.2,
      "end": 4786.15,
      "text": "just a little away from Neasden",
      "source": "uncertain"
    },
    {
      "start": 4786.15,
      "end": 4788.26,
      "text": "and this one",
      "source": "uncertain"
    },
    {
      "start": 4788.26,
      "end": 4789.32,
      "text": "it's called",
      "source": "uncertain"
    },
    {
      "start": 4789.32,
      "end": 4792.36,
      "text": "Funny Feeling",
      "source": "uncertain"
    },
    {
      "start": 4792.36,
      "end": 4795.36,
      "text": "this is Chainsaw Massacre",
      "source": "uncertain"
    },
    {
      "start": 5719.18,
      "end": 5722.78,
      "text": "all you Chainsaw fans out there",
      "source": "uncertain"
    },
    {
      "start": 5722.78,
      "end": 5724.42,
      "text": "this is one from Defector",
      "source": "uncertain"
    },
    {
      "start": 5724.42,
      "end": 5729.37,
      "text": "and this one's called Slogans",
      "source": "uncertain"
    },
    {
      "start": 5729.37,
      "end": 5732.37,
      "text": "this one's from Acolyte again",
      "source": "uncertain"
    },
    {
      "start": 6018.18,
      "end": 6021.5,
      "text": "It's called Tower Struck Down",
      "source": "uncertain"
    },
    {
      "start": 6021.5,
      "end": 6024.5,
      "text": "The drums, Ian Mosley",
      "source": "uncertain"
    },
    {
      "start": 6583.52,
      "end": 6588.42,
      "text": "And on bass, Chess Kronk",
      "source": "uncertain"
    },
    {
      "start": 6588.42,
      "end": 6591.42,
      "text": "1981, the Taxi Herber clocks",
      "source": "uncertain"
    },
    {
      "start": 7029.9,
      "end": 7031.64,
      "text": "The show, Spectral Mornings",
      "source": "uncertain"
    },
    {
      "start": 7031.64,
      "end": 7032.62,
      "text": "The Tower Struck Down",
      "source": "uncertain"
    },
    {
      "start": 7032.62,
      "end": 7034.32,
      "text": "Slogans, Overnight Sleeper",
      "source": "uncertain"
    },
    {
      "start": 7034.32,
      "end": 7035.92,
      "text": "The Steps, Funny Feeling",
      "source": "TV"
    },
    {
      "start": 7035.92,
      "end": 7037.34,
      "text": "Ace of Wands, Everyday",
      "source": "uncertain"
    },
    {
      "start": 7037.34,
      "end": 7039.44,
      "text": "And the Air Conditioned Nightmare",
      "source": "uncertain"
    },
    {
      "start": 7039.44,
      "end": 7042.99,
      "text": "Productions by Tony Wilson",
      "source": "TV"
    },
    {
      "start": 7042.99,
      "end": 7045.61,
      "text": "And my engineers tonight were Michael and Barry",
      "source": "uncertain"
    },
    {
      "start": 7045.61,
      "end": 7049.05,
      "text": "Hope you've enjoyed our coverage",
      "source": "TV"
    },
    {
      "start": 7049.05,
      "end": 7051.33,
      "text": "Of the Reading Festival for 1981 this year",
      "source": "TV"
    },
    {
      "start": 7051.33,
      "end": 7053.05,
      "text": "Next week we return to normal",
      "source": "uncertain"
    },
    {
      "start": 7053.05,
      "end": 7055.31,
      "text": "on the Friday Rock Show with a load of records.",
      "source": "uncertain"
    },
    {
      "start": 7055.43,
      "end": 7059.97,
      "text": "And I'll be back with you for Rock On 5 to 6.30 tomorrow on Radio 1.",
      "source": "TV"
    },
    {
      "start": 7062.54,
      "end": 7064.1,
      "text": "Until then, have yourselves a great night.",
      "source": "uncertain"
    },
    {
      "start": 7064.46,
      "end": 7067.12,
      "text": "This is Tommy Vance on behalf of everybody on Radio 1.",
      "source": "uncertain"
    },
    {
      "start": 7067.3,
      "end": 7068.54,
      "text": "Wishing you well wherever you are.",
      "source": "uncertain"
    },
    {
      "start": 7068.68,
      "end": 7069.66,
      "text": "Take care. Good night.",
      "source": "uncertain"
    }
  ]
